# GitHub publish (مع بمب الكاش)

When the user says things like **انشر** / **ارفع** / **انشر تاني** / **publish**:

1. Set git safe.directory for this repo via env (do not edit global git config):
   `GIT_CONFIG_COUNT=1`, `GIT_CONFIG_KEY_0=safe.directory`, `GIT_CONFIG_VALUE_0=D:/websites/Digitalbwsla.com`
2. Run `node build.cjs` so `site-config.cjs` `assetVersion` regenerates (`?v=` on CSS/JS/logos).
3. `git add -A`, commit with a short message, push `origin main`.
4. Use commit identity via `-c` only: `user.name=amr-bwsla`, `user.email=321912392+amr-bwsla@users.noreply.github.com`
5. Reply with the preview URL including the new version:
   `https://amr-bwsla.github.io/digital-bwsla/?v=<asset-version>`
   Extract `<asset-version>` from `index.html` meta `asset-version`.

Do **not** only push without rebuild. Cache bust is required every publish.
